adjudication.rationale:
In EventManager.ts the diff changes the check to:
```ts
const [mainHostDestinationCalendar] = evt.destinationCalendar ?? [];
if (evt.location === MeetLocationType && mainHostDestinationCalendar.integration !== "google_calendar")
```
If `evt.destinationCalendar` is `null/undefined` or an empty array, destructuring yields `mainHostDestinationCalendar === undefined`, and accessing `.integration` will throw a TypeError. The diff elsewhere explicitly allows/creates `destinationCalendar: []` (e.g., bookingReminder.ts and handleCancelBooking.ts), so this crash is verifiable from the diff.
